==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[tuttugu]]'' meaning "[[twenty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[fimm]]'' "[[five]]". Meaning '''twenty and five'''.

===Numeral===
{{head|is|numeral}}

# '''[[twenty-five]]'''; the cardinal number after [[tuttugu og fjórir#Icelandic|tuttugu og fjórir]] and before [[tuttugu og sex#Icelandic|tuttugu og sex]].

